  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Rogan josh is a slow-braised lamb curry coloured deep red by "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Kashmiri chilli powder",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "kashmiri-chilli"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ". The lamb is browned in oil with whole spices, then braised in yogurt and ground spices until the sauce has reduced to a thick, oil-rimmed coating around the tender meat. The process takes two hours but most of that is oven time with no attention needed."
          }
        ]
      },
